10
00:45:54,545 --> 00:46:00,545
John Wick is an American media franchise created by Derek Kolstad.

11
00:50:30,000 --> 00:50:36,000
It centers on a neo-noir action thriller film series directed by Chad Stahelski
featuring the eponymous character portrayed by Keanu Reeves.

12
00:55:05,454 --> 00:55:11,454
Wick is a legendary hitman who is reluctantly drawn back
into the criminal underworld after retiring.

13
00:59:40,909 --> 00:59:46,909
The franchise began with the release of John Wick (2014), which was followed by three
sequels: Chapter 2 (2017), Chapter 3 – Parabellum (2019), and Chapter 4 (2023).

14
01:04:16,363 --> 01:04:22,363
Various spin-offs expanded the franchise: the prequel comic book series John Wick: The Book of Rules (2017–2019),
the prequel television miniseries The Continental (2023), and the spinoff film Ballerina (2025).

15
01:08:51,818 --> 01:08:57,818
The films have received critical acclaim, and have been considered
one of the greatest action film series of all time.

16
01:13:27,272 --> 01:13:33,272
Some critics and publications consider the first film, as well as
Chapter 4, as two of the greatest action films ever made.

17
01:18:02,727 --> 01:18:08,727
The films have earned a collective gross of more than $1 billion worldwide.

18
01:22:38,181 --> 01:22:44,181
Stahelski, Basil Iwanyk, and Erica Lee serve in
oversight roles for the John Wick franchise.

19
01:27:13,636 --> 01:27:19,636
87North Productions, Thunder Road Films, and Lionsgate produce the franchise.

20
01:31:49,090 --> 01:31:55,090
The film explores themes of hitman, bratva (russian
mafia), gangster, secret organization, revenge.

21
01:36:24,545 --> 01:36:30,545
The tone is intense.
